OL,3,GNEWSAIpswich Town investigates racist
OL,4,Aabuse of Fatawu
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way after an
OL,7,FIpswich Town footballer was racially
OL,8,Fabused online.
OL,10,FThe club said on social media it was
OL,11,F"aware of online racist abuse" directed
OL,12,Fat attacker Abdul Fatawu, calling it
OL,13,F"completely unacceptable".
OL,15,FIt came after the Ghanaian winger, 22,
OL,16,Fwas sent off during Town's 1-0 defeat
OL,17,Fto Everton on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
