OL,3,GNEWSAIpswich Town investigates racist
OL,4,Aabuse of Fatawu
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club said: "We are investigating
OL,7,Fthis incident alongside the Premier
OL,8,FLeague and the relevant authorities. We
OL,9,Fwill continue to offer Abdul our full
OL,10,Fsupport."
